   "title": "先说“变换”",
   "subtitle": "先说“变换”。它就是一个函数：输入一个向量，输出一个向量。",
   "badge": "l05",
   "chapter": "s2",
   "image": "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/renders/thumbs/l05.jpg"
  },
  {
   "t": 36.41,
