   "title": "与其一个一个去看",
   "subtitle": "与其一个一个去看，不如把每个向量都当成一个点，看整张网格怎么动。",
   "badge": "l06",
   "chapter": "s2",
   "image": "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/renders/thumbs/l06.jpg"
  },
  {
   "t": 43.08,
   "end": 52.64,
   "title": "比如这一次",
   "subtitle": "比如这一次：横轴上的点不动，上方的点往右滑，下方的往左滑，离横轴越远，滑得越多。",
   "badge": "l07",
   "chapter": "s2",
   "image": "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/renders/thumbs/l07.jpg"
  },
  {
