   "title": "线性代数只关心一类特别规矩的变换",
   "subtitle": "线性代数只关心一类特别规矩的变换，叫线性变换。",
   "badge": "l08",
   "chapter": "s2",
   "image": "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/renders/thumbs/l08.jpg"
  },
  {
   "t": 58.83,
   "end": 67.24,
   "title": "规矩只有两条",
   "subtitle": "规矩只有两条：原点不动；任何直线变完还是直线，网格线依旧平行、间距均匀。",
   "badge": "l09",
   "chapter": "s2",
   "image": "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/renders/thumbs/l09.jpg"
  },
  {
   "t": 67.59,
   "end": 71.51,
   "title": "像这样把线弄弯的，不算",
   "subtitle": "像这样把线弄弯的，不算。",
   "badge": "l10",
   "chapter": "s2",
   "image": "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/renders/thumbs/l10.jpg"
  },
  {
   "t": 71.86,
   "end": 76.33,
   "title": "像这样整体挪开，原点跑掉的，也不算",
   "subtitle": "像这样整体挪开，原点跑掉的，也不算。",
   "badge": "l11",
   "chapter": "s2",
   "image": "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/renders/thumbs/l11.jpg"
  },
  {
   "t": 77.83,
   "end": 84.16,
   "title": "那问题来了",
   "subtitle": "那问题来了：平面上有无穷多个点，怎么描述一次线性变换？",
   "badge": "l12",
   "chapter": "s3",
   "image": "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/renders/thumbs/l12.jpg"
  },
  {
   "t": 84.51,
   "end": 88.2,
   "title": "答案出奇地省事",
   "subtitle": "答案出奇地省事：只要盯住两个向量。",
   "badge": "l13",
   "chapter": "s3",
   "image": "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/renders/thumbs/l13.jpg"
  },
  {
   "t": 88.56,
   "end": 99.6,
   "title": "一个叫 i，向右一格",
   "subtitle": "一个叫 i，向右一格；一个叫 j，向上一格。头上的小帽子表示长度为一，它们叫基向量。",
   "badge": "l14",
   "chapter": "s3",
   "image": "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/renders/thumbs/l14.jpg"
  },
  {
   "t": 99.95,
   "end": 110.13,
   "title": "任何向量都能用它们拼出来",
   "subtitle": "任何向量都能用它们拼出来。比如这个向量，负一、二，就是负一个 i，加上两个 j。",
   "badge": "l15",
   "chapter": "s3",
   "image": "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/renders/thumbs/l15.jpg"
  },
  {
   "t": 110.48,
   "end": 125.43,
   "title": "现在做变换",
   "subtitle": "现在做变换。负一个 i 加两个 j，就是沿着网格往左走一格，再往上走两格。网格怎么变，这条路线就跟着怎么变，步数不会变。",
   "badge": "l16",
   "chapter": "s3",
   "image": "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/renders/thumbs/l16.jpg"
  },
  {
   "t": 125.78,
   "end": 133.48,
   "title": "变换后的向量，依然是负一个新的 i",
   "subtitle": "变换后的向量，依然是负一个新的 i，加上两个新的 j。",
   "badge": "l17",
   "chapter": "s3",
   "image": "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/renders/thumbs/l17.jpg"
  },
  {
   "t": 133.83,
   "end": 140.55,
   "title": "所以，只要知道 i 落到哪、j 落到哪",
   "subtitle": "所以，只要知道 i 落到哪、j 落到哪，整个平面去哪儿，就全都确定了。",
   "badge": "l18",
   "chapter": "s3",
   "image": "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/renders/thumbs/l18.jpg"
  },
  {
   "t": 142.07,
   "end": 147.87,
   "title": "看刚才那次变换",
   "subtitle": "看刚才那次变换：i 没动，还在一、零；j 被推到了一、一。",
   "badge": "l19",
   "chapter": "s4",
   "image": "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/renders/thumbs/l19.jpg"
  },
  {
   "t": 148.22,
   "end": 153.06,
   "title": "把 i 的落点写成第一列",
   "subtitle": "把 i 的落点写成第一列，j 的落点写成第二列。",
   "badge": "l20",
   "chapter": "s4",
   "image": "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/renders/thumbs/l20.jpg"
  },
  {
   "t": 153.41,
   "end": 159.45,
   "title": "这就是开头那个矩阵",
   "subtitle": "这就是开头那个矩阵。它的两列，就是两个基向量的新位置。",
   "badge": "l21",
   "chapter": "s4",
   "image": "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/renders/thumbs/l21.jpg"
  },
  {
   "t": 159.8,
   "end": 180.76,
   "title": "那矩阵乘向量呢？",
   "subtitle": "那矩阵乘向量呢？任意向量 x、y，就是 x 个 i 加 y 个 j；变换以后，就是 x 个新的 i 加 y 个新的 j，也就是 x 倍的第一列，加上 y 倍的第二列。",
   "badge": "l22",
   "chapter": "s4",
   "image": "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/renders/thumbs/l22.jpg"
  },
  {
   "t": 181.11,
   "end": 187.35,
   "title": "合起来就是 x 加 y、y",
   "subtitle": "合起来就是 x 加 y、y，和开头课本行乘列算出来的，一模一样。",
   "badge": "l33",
   "chapter": "s4",
   "image": "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/renders/thumbs/l33.jpg"
  },
  {
   "t": 187.7,
   "end": 196.0,
   "title": "代入负一、二",
   "subtitle": "代入负一、二：负一倍的一、零，加上两倍的一、一，得到一、二。",
   "badge": "l23",
   "chapter": "s4",
   "image": "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/renders/thumbs/l23.jpg"
  },
  {
   "t": 196.35,
   "end": 206.35,
   "title": "再看画面，这个向量正好落在一、二",
   "subtitle": "再看画面，这个向量正好落在一、二。算式和运动，说的是同一件事。",
   "badge": "l24",
   "chapter": "s4",
   "image": "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/renders/thumbs/l24.jpg"
  },
  {
