   "title": "第一列说，i 去了零、一，也就是正上方",
   "subtitle": "第一列说，i 去了零、一，也就是正上方。",
   "badge": "l27",
   "chapter": "s5",
   "image": "edu_videos/linear_algebra/t03_matrix_as_transform/renders/thumbs/l27.jpg"
  },
